### Actualizar el estado de órdenes de un plan de trabajo — resultado esperado (200)
### orders es un string JSON: arreglo de objetos con orderId
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "[{\"orderId\":1},{\"orderId\":2}]",
  "orderStatusId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "[{\"orderId\":1}]",
  "orderStatusId": 1
}

### Validación: sin orders → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderStatusId": 1
}

### Validación: sin orderStatusId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "[{\"orderId\":1}]"
}

### Validación: orders vacío → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "",
  "orderStatusId": 1
}
